<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-7916] GA Grid examples should be ready for auto run on TeamCity</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7916</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If we start examples MovieGAExample or OptimizeMakeChangeGAExample on TC, this examples will return exit code 1. TeamCity think that it&apos;s a error and mark stop whole build of examples package.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;That behavior should be changed. If we don&apos;t have required system properties we should not return exit code 1 or maybe set and use some default values.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13144268">IGNITE-7916</key>
