&lt;p&gt;As for PR - the problem not in &lt;em&gt;Ignition.stop(true);&lt;/em&gt; but in &lt;em&gt;System.exit(1);&lt;/em&gt;. For self check you could use org/apache/ignite/testsuites/IgniteExamplesMLTestSuite.java&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Also please check that javadoc is valid(org/apache/ignite/examples/ml/genetic/helloworld/HelloWorldTerminateCriteria.java:76).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thanks.&lt;/p&gt;

